  "hw_notes": [
    "lm dims all %64; head_dim 128 -> rope halves are one full SRAM row each",
    "lm mlp = relu^2: fc1 with clamp(0,inf) epilogue, then eltwise_mul(x,x), then fc2 (no fused relu^2)",
    "lm fc2 K=9216 > SCALE_BRAM_ELEMENTS 8192: quantized_matmat_core cannot take it; split K or run fc2 unfused via matmat_mul_core",
    "M-RoPE: cos/sin tables built on host from (t,h,w) positions; token after last image = index + rope_delta (data-dependent, rewrite tables per prompt)",
    "vision head_dim 72 -> pad to 128 for flash attention, unpad after (strided DMA, chunk 160B rule)",
    "vision mlp 4304 -> pad to 4352 (zero rows in fc1/bias, zero cols in fc2)",
    "vision seq 720 -> 768 and 364 -> 384 with -inf softmax mask on pad columns; attention is per image (22 runs, 2 shapes)",
    "vision GELU is tanh-approx; hardware GELU is x*sigmoid(1.702x) -> known SNR ceiling, same deviation as pi05/smolvlm2",
    "pos-emb bilinear resize + patchify on host (2 static shapes); patch embed 768->1152 on device",
    "expert attends non-causally to [LM KV cache ; 64 self]; kv_len 3274+64 padded to 64-multiple with mask",
    "expert Fourier features need sin/cos of the current noisy action each Euler step: no sin core -> host round trip per step (64x2 values) or CORDIC",
    "bf16 everything = 4.7GB: LM must be q4/IF4; embedding table stays on host"
  ]
